---
const { locale = "en" } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === "zh-Hant";
---
<aside class="notice" role="note">
  <strong>{isZh ? "封存文章" : "Archived note"}</strong><br/>
  {isZh
    ? "本頁為保存參考而保留，現時不再主動維護；部分方法、連結或結論可能已被後續工作取代。"
    : "This page is preserved for reference and is no longer actively maintained. Some methods, links, or conclusions may have been superseded."}
</aside>
